<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen 1996 industry output rises 17.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkmen 1996 industry output rises 17.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial production grew by 17.9 percent last year, compared to 1995, a report from the State Statistics Comittee said on Thursday.</p>
<p> TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-Dec 96  Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> year-on-year pct change	  +17.9	 +26.6	  -6.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
